  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports Production Monitoring for a mining concentrator with 20 processing units across Primary/Secondary/Tertiary Crushing, Grinding (SAG and Ball Mills), Concentration (Flotation, Thickeners), Material Handling (Conveyors, Stackers), and Classification (Vibrating Screens). Stakeholders include the Processing Plant Lead (throughput, recovery, downtime), Mine Manager (mine-to-mill alignment), Reliability VP (faulted units, utilization, downtime), and CFO (energy intensity, plan adherence, concentrate output to revenue).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Throughput = throughput_tph (instantaneous, ~100-1000 tph) or actual_throughput_tpd (daily, ~2-20 ktpd)\n- Recovery = recovery_pct; target 85-92% for sulfide flotation circuits\n- Energy intensity = energy_kwh_per_ton; SAG grinding benchmark 7-10 kWh/t\n- Utilization = utilization_pct on throughput_snapshots; target 85%+ on critical path\n- Plan adherence = actual_throughput_tpd / planned_throughput_tpd; target 95%+\n- Bottleneck = bottleneck_flag = 'Yes' on throughput_snapshots\n- Unit status = Running / Idle / Maintenance / Fault on processing_units\n- Quality = quality_status (On Spec / Marginal / Off Spec) on production_readings\n- Concentrate grade = concentrate_grade_pct; benchmark 25-35% for copper concentrate\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - production_kpi_monthly (source: processing_units) — dims: record_date, unit_type, processing_stage, unit_status; measures: avg_throughput_tph, avg_recovery_pct, avg_energy_per_ton, running_count, total_unit_count, max_throughput_tph.\n  - throughput_kpi_monthly (source: throughput_snapshots) — dims: snapshot_date, unit_type, processing_stage, bottleneck_flag; measures: total_planned_tpd, total_actual_tpd, avg_utilization, total_downtime, bottleneck_count, unique_unit_count, max_planned_throughput_tpd.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. unit_id, unit_name, ore_grade_pct, concentrate_grade_pct, planned_throughput_tpd, actual_throughput_tpd).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Show monthly average mill throughput (tph) by processing stage for the trailing 12 months.",
    "Top 10 processing units by total unplanned downtime hours this quarter — which stage is driving it?",
    "Which units are most frequently flagged as bottlenecks, and what is their average utilization?",
    "How has plant recovery trended month-over-month by unit type across grinding and concentration?",
    "Top 10 units by energy intensity (kWh/ton) — and how do they rank by processing stage?",
    "What is the plan adherence (actual vs. planned TPD) by processing stage for the last 90 days?",
    "Which units had the most Off Spec quality readings in the last quarter, and what was their average concentrate grade?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "How has average throughput tons per hour trended by month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT record_date, MEASURE(avg_throughput_tph) AS avg_throughput_tph",
        "FROM {fqn}.production_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY record_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average throughput tph changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT record_date, MEASURE(avg_throughput_tph) AS avg_throughput_tph",
        "FROM {fqn}.production_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY record_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What has been the peak planned throughput tons/day each month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, MEASURE(max_planned_throughput_tpd) AS max_planned_throughput_tpd",
        "FROM {fqn}.throughput_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has bottleneck count changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, MEASURE(bottleneck_count) AS bottleneck_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.throughput_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How does total throughput tons per hour break down by unit id for 'Fault' records?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT unit_id, COUNT(*) AS record_count, SUM(throughput_tph) AS total_throughput_tph",
        "FROM {fqn}.processing_units",
        "WHERE unit_status = 'Fault' GROUP BY unit_id ORDER BY total_throughput_tph DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total average particle size mm over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT reading_date, SUM(particle_size_mm) AS total_particle_size_mm",
        "FROM {fqn}.production_readings",
        "GROUP BY reading_date ORDER BY reading_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average equipment utilization 0-100 changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, AVG(utilization_pct) AS avg_utilization_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.throughput_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    }
  ],
